$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Compound 8. Compound 11. Compound 11 was
synthesized using the procedure described for the synthesis of 8. Only
the mixture was heated at reflux with vigorous stirring for 4 h to give
the uncyclized product as a red solid in yield of 69%. Due to high
activity of the pyridine proton in solution, only MS was recorded. MS
(MALDI-TOF): cacld for M-, 864.4; found, 864.3.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
