Thomas; Taylor, J. David; Sigethy, Scott D.; Tomberlin, Ginger H.;
Hassell, Annie M.; Kahler, Kirsten M.; Shewchuk, Lisa M.; Gampe, Robert
T.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Medicinal Chemistry (2012), 55(16), 7193-7207

