$DATUM N-(3-(5-Chloro-2-(1-methyl-1H-pyrazol-4-yl)-1H-pyrrolo[2,3-b]pyridin-3-yl)benzyl)acetamide
(16c) To a stirred suspension of
N-(3-(5-chloro-2-iodo-1H-pyrrolo[2,3-b]pyridin-3-yl)benzyl)acetamide
(45.0 mg, 0.106 mmol) and 1-methyl-1H-pyrazole-4-boronic acid pinacol
ester (23.0 mg, 0.11 mmol) in toluene (0.78 mL), EtOH (0.223 mL) and 2M
aqueous Na2CO3 (0.111 mL) was added PdCl2(dppf)·CH2Cl2 (5.0 mg, 0.006
mmol). The reaction was heated to 80 °C for 16 h before cooling to
ambient temperature. Once cooled the reaction was concentrated in vacuo
then dry loaded onto silica. Purification was accomplished by flash
chromatography on silica gel eluting with MeOH/CH2Cl2 (5-10%), The title
compound (28 mg, 69 % yield) as an off-white solid. 1H-NMR (500 MHz,
DMSO-d6) 1.88 (s, 3H, -NHCOCH3), 3.86 (s, 3H, -CH3), 4.32 (d, J = 5.8 Hz,
2H, -CH2-), 7.28 (d, J = 7.6 Hz, 1H, CHar), 7.33 (d, J = 7.6 Hz, 1H,
CHar), 7.38 (br s, 1H, CHar), 7.44 (t, J = 7.6 Hz, 1H, CHar), 7.66 (s,
1H, CHar), 7.74 (d, J = 2.2 Hz, 1H, CHar), 7.87 (s, 1H, CHar), 8.21 (d, J
= 2.2 Hz, 1H, CHar), 8.41 (t, J = 5.8 Hz, 1H, -NHCOCH3), 12.22 (br s, 1H,
-CNHC-); LC-MS (ESI, m/z): Rt = 2.48 min -380, 382 [(M+H)+, Cl isotopic
pattern]; HRMS: Found 380.1274; calculated for C20H19ClN5O (M+H)+:
380.1273.
