J = 13.4 Hz, 1 H), 4.85 (d, J = 13.4 Hz, 1 H), 4.65 (dt, J = 12.0, 1.1
Hz, 1 H), 4.48 (d, J = 11.7 Hz, 1 H), 4.30-4.22 (m, 3 H). Anal.
