$DATUM 5,5’-Bis[2-(triisopropylsilyl)thiazol-5-yl]-2,2’-bithiophene.
2-(Triisopropylsilyl)-5-(4,4,5-trimethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)thiazole
(15.0 g, 40.8 mmol), 5,5’-dibromo-2,2’-bithiophene[2] (4.40 g, 13.6
mmol), Pd2dba3·CHCl3 (70 mg, 0.5 mol% regarding
5,5’-dibromo-2,2’-bithiophene), S-Phos (56 mg, 1 mol% regarding
5,5’-dibromo-2,2’-bithiophene) and K3Cl4 (8.7 g, 41.0 mmol) were
dissolved in a degassed mixture of toluene and water (10/1, 300 mL) and
stirred at 65 °C for 24 h. The solvent was removed in vacuo and the brown
mixture was purified by silica gel column chromatography. Impurities were
eluted using pentane/dichloromethane (1/1). Subsequently, elution with
ethyl acetate gave 6.0 g (9.3 mmol) of the product in 68% yield as yellow
solids. Melting Point (DSC): 158 °C; TGA: 329 °C. 1H NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3,
298 K): δ [ppm] = 8.15 (s, 1H, 4-H); 7.11 (d, 3JHH = 3.8 Hz, 1H, 7-H);
7.09 (d, 3JHH = 3.8 Hz, 1H, 8-H); 1.44 (sept, 3JHH = 7.5 Hz, 3H,
SiCH(CH3)2); 1.15 (d, 3JHH = 7.5 Hz, 18H, SiCH(CH3)2). 13C{1H} NMR (151
MHz, CDCl3, 298 K): δ [ppm] = 169.9 (C2); 141.7 (C4); 136.9, 134.6, 132.9
(C5, C6, C9); 126.7 (C7); 124.8 (C8); 18.7 (SiCH(CH3)2); 11.9
(SiCH(CH3)2). GCOSY (600/600 MHz, CDCl3, 298 K): δ (1H/1H) [ppm] =
7.11/7.09 (7-H/8-H); 7.09/7.11 (8-H/7-H); 1.44/1.15
(SiCH(CH3)2/SiCH(CH3)2); 1.15/1.44 (SiCH(CH3)2/SiCH(CH3)2). GHSQC
(151/600 MHz, CDCl3, 298 K): δ (13C/1H) [ppm] = 141.7/8.15 (C4/4-H);
126.7/7.11 (C7/7-H); 124.8/7.09 (C8/8-H); 18.7/1.15
(SiCH(CH3)2/SiCH(CH3)2); 11.9/1.44 (SiCH(CH3)2/SiCH(CH3)2). GHMBC
(151/600 MHz, CDCl3, 298 K): δ (13C/1H) [ppm] = 169.9/8.15 (C2/4-H);
169.9/1.44 (C2/CH(CH3)2); 136.9/7.09 (C5/8-H); 134.6/8.15 (C6/4-H);
134.6/7.11 (C6/7-H); 132.9/8.15 (C9/4-H); 132.9/7.11 (C9/7-H); 126.7/7.09
(C7/8-H); 124.8/7.11 (C8/7-H); 18.7/1.44 (SiCH(CH3)2/SiCH(CH3)2);
11.9/1.15 (SiCH(CH3)2/SiCH(CH3)2). 29Si DEPT NMR (60 MHz, CDCl3, 298 K):
δ [ppm] = 2.6. IR (ATR): ν = 2942 (w), 2865 (w), 1457 (w), 1364 (m), 1248
(w), 1152 (m), 1063 (w), 997 (m), 879 (m), 798 (m), 686 (m); 654 (m).
Mass Spec. (C32H48N2S4Si2, ESI): calculated for [M+ H]+ 645.2312, found
645.2300. Elemental analysis: (%) calcd for C32H48N2S4Si2 (645.2): C
59.57, H 7.50, N 4.34; found: C 59.13, H 7.29, N 4.07.
